OL,3,GNEWSAFly-tipping fears over booking    
OL,4,Asystem at tips                         
OL,6,FCouncillors in Worcestershire have said
OL,7,Fthey are worried fly-tipping could     
OL,8,Fincrease once a booking system is      
OL,9,Flaunched at household recycling centres
OL,10,Fin the county.                         
OL,12,FThe change is expected to come into    
OL,13,Fforce in February or March next year,  
OL,14,Fat all 11 tips, in a bid to save       
OL,15,F#500,000 a year.                       
OL,17,FConservative councillor Dan Birch said:
OL,18,F"More than 2,500 people signed a       
OL,19,Fpetition against this, but they haven't
OL,20,Fbeen listened to."                     
