OL,3,GNEWSAFly-tipping fears over booking    
OL,4,Asystem at tips                         
OL,6,FWorcestershire County Council's        
OL,7,Fleadership said the launch of the      
OL,8,Fbooking system would be reviewed after 
OL,9,Fsix months to assess the impact.       
